{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25444","headline":"思山居一十首 忆葛胜木禅床 · 李德裕","name":"思山居一十首 忆葛胜木禅床","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆我斋中榻，寒宵几独眠。\n管宁穿亦坐，徐孺去常悬。\n虫网垂应遍，苔痕染更鲜。\n何人及身在，归对老僧禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}